  "chapterId": "old-v021",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-0-v1",
      "text": "符道昭是淮西人。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "d67c21c9ed36b0da6cb366e4ed223796dc88292b8d48b098cb01f95eb35b8fc0",
      "originalEnd": 8,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 0,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-1-v1",
      "text": "他性情强悍敏捷，有军事谋略，秦宗权把他当作心腹，让他监督各军，后来任骑兵将领。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f096858e8fdcb109339db14fe3385419b81c90585ea6b22462ccda02d8a99b60",
      "originalEnd": 35,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 8,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-2-v1",
      "text": "他尤其擅长布阵，当时以勇武闻名。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "3c30254413b8be5485d23f749ffcfce1a1d4e0733d90713fff345e45b739654a",
      "originalEnd": 45,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 35,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-3-v1",
      "text": "但他刚强却缺乏操守，善于迎合别人，初次见面仿佛倾吐全部肺腑，使人必定喜爱他的才能，而道昭的心意却又飘忽不定。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "6b1b67d209379a29133e2d40dbe18fd3cd5cc70a410ac29ad253089f0f2f5f14",
      "originalEnd": 77,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 45,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-4-v1",
      "text": "秦宗权将要败亡时，有一个叫薛潜的人，分立了军队，道昭对亲近的人说：“蔡州已经衰弱了。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "2719198b08b1ae2e5ffc1e89935a901ad6951bfd18bd0d3b47bb0087020a3b77",
      "originalEnd": 108,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 77,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-5-v1",
      "text": "于是归附薛潜。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "8ad98055d750697bfa60e3b99ea88a7b393539b5e91defcd4fbde23e71ecbcbb",
      "originalEnd": 112,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 108,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-6-v1",
      "text": "薛潜快要失败时，他又逃到洋州，依附葛佐。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "21686ce13cfecd214dedc4a2040f66689d39e8e25da6ff230f082db93a84a20b",
      "originalEnd": 124,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 112,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-7-v1",
      "text": "葛佐进攻兴元军失利，他又逃到岐州。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "e1065c682fb7f5f7907a7f5c777cb30e95c4753a7a66602eb19e72afa9767642",
      "originalEnd": 137,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 124,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-8-v1",
      "text": "宋文通喜爱他，把他收为自己的儿子，给他改名继远，因此他也改了姓氏。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "2c043c8720f8eacceadf3b103f4692d99951a9b1db1be87b37a77fd834795064",
      "originalEnd": 157,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 137,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-9-v1",
      "text": "得到军职后，他的职位全都超过同辈。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "3f53b743f49e2403ff36d9818f05c7033a4b4bae51d782a1249880558c2fc12c",
      "originalEnd": 167,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 157,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-10-v1",
      "text": "后来任巴州刺史，又由宋文通上表，请任他为陇州防御使，兼中军都指挥使。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "8999a7a981cd412daaf142575f9c9e142f1729050fb1901cc8f22fa39c7e98be",
      "originalEnd": 190,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 167,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-11-v1",
      "text": "朱温到岐州城下驻军，迎接唐昭宗，道昭多次率骑兵奋勇作战，却屡次被汴军击败，便前来投降。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "377db72f9f1e8955c5727bbd55ab2100600511cd8d5d069a7ef6db3357b85a42",
      "originalEnd": 224,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 190,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-12-v1",
      "text": "朱温一向听说他的名声，对待他十分优厚。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "629ce6ddd90f3d0b4c4fe2d8d8aac5023a1e0d85d8f7f41aee49cb996c862b57",
      "originalEnd": 236,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 224,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-13-v1",
      "text": "唐昭宗恢复正常朝廷秩序后，朱温上表，请授道昭秦州节度使、同平章事，并派兵护送接应，未能成功，便返回了。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "42f4a8d6045b304af59130b1d72a806d99869fe96b0dfaeedec069935633d296",
      "originalEnd": 264,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 236,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-14-v1",
      "text": "此前，李周彝放弃鄜州，亲自前来归附，被任为元帅府行军左司马，在朱温幕府中受到的宠遇无人能及。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "362eba87eea857ea22208e335867ebd38367a26a7cfe42d70e5286c27f43ac09",
      "originalEnd": 294,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 264,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-15-v1",
      "text": "道昭来到后，朱温任他为右司马，让他和周彝共同统领寇彦卿、南大丰、阎宝以下大军，讨伐沧州。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "8e2b96940498c0769b2e54c38372390e161065e0833bd91751483e3358908d95",
      "originalEnd": 329,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 294,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-16-v1",
      "text": "朱温到魏州讨伐牙军时，中军前面的魏博将领、山河营指挥使左行迁，听说府中发生变乱，便带兵回驻历亭，自称留后，跟从作乱的有几万人。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "67592e0b668895e1bdc2afbba3fe63b3e5182f89e11110090dfbeee849c808bb",
      "originalEnd": 382,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 329,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-17-v1",
      "text": "道昭协助周彝，与彦卿等人大败这些军队，杀死四万多人，擒获左行迁，将他斩杀。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "52dc0fb7d912c5ac781025dd25a1785d5331e0badc74633efd7b3ea884a7d4b8",
      "originalEnd": 410,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 382,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-18-v1",
      "text": "又有史仁遇聚集几万人，占据高唐，他们也将他击败，擒获仁遇献给朱温。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "88cbde48b4585fafb7de8aaf3fd2764e3e7215b631cbb864362a647284e3b598",
      "originalEnd": 433,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 410,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-19-v1",
      "text": "他们乘胜夺取澶州、博州，平定两州，又杀死一万多人。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "d1b3544bcfbeda9766c58c1e87ad7bc36700c51d85cc03231ad9d56f132b71f3",
      "originalEnd": 451,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 433,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-20-v1",
      "text": "道昭性情勇敢果决，常率先冲击敌阵，多次遭受挫败，而周彝、彦卿从两翼接着进攻，接连报捷；监督军队的人上报功劳不实，都把道昭列在首位。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "61453df0d1e25d4635b24a1ae7027747f026ff35c7513178d9d2ca80286c045f",
      "originalEnd": 499,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 451,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-21-v1",
      "text": "朱温暗中知道这些情况，对他们都没有议定赏赐。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "17c4ef5d5bcbcc8950775aafc7e8334607b75e37c64fe615259b2bdd3a2540e6",
      "originalEnd": 510,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 499,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-22-v1",
      "text": "围攻沧州时，不用骑兵，朱温命道昭到唐阳放牧战马。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "5f4d71a44167a059c3650d4190ffa97af72bc40a8cfff60eb79b32c4bdd0f42c",
      "originalEnd": 531,
      "paragraphId": "old-v021-p8",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 510,
      "originalSha256": "a77c1b728398c04345a43ff9b05348f3dee467c05d0b9699cb8a4c775cc94c1a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "10462",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "cac82709bd82ce6dea1507d2284b8e6a36e71edf26d189213a3d361e6a76a67c",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v021-p8-m04-r2-23-v1",
      "text": "朱温接受唐朝禅让、称帝后，把兵权交给道昭，让他与康怀英等进攻潞州，用“蚰蜓堑”环绕城池，围得飞鸟也无法通过。",
